From 077df6295d7e6343a28d40a17102cc2ab52c4316 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:45:02 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Stack tab switcher: '+ New tab' bar and iconified overflow
 menu (Kiwi style)

Top bar: '+ New tab' control on the left (incognito-aware), overflow menu on the right, no tab
counter/incognito toggle. Menu: New tab, New Incognito tab, Close all tabs, Settings with Material
icons (PopupMenu.setForceShowIcon).
